            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Additionally, fluctuations in our revenues generated from advertising (\"Google advertising\"), other sources (\"Google subscriptions, platforms, and devices\"), Google Cloud, and Other Bets have been, and may continue to be, affected by other factors unique to each set of revenues, as described below.",
          "text_hash": "61de6a9b75e631f3551662404c0bee253e0cf4cf83231f3733c8b0d8348ae490",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000416-548f9d2e",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[447]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 416,
          "reported_page": 29,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-style": "italic",
            "font-weight": "700",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Google Services",
          "text_hash": "548f9d2e40acf70d4b8c59fb7a2be6427c4cb97cc2e359fb74b25f5166e1556b",
          "type": "heading_candidate"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000417-a9697220",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[448]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 417,
          "reported_page": 29,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Google Services revenues consist of Google advertising as well as Google subscriptions, platforms, and devices revenues.",
          "text_hash": "a969722067e9744a943b0e0edd4afa4b285ef2a443cacec6e5154425ebe554a7",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000418-6fbc0dcb",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[449]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 418,
          "reported_page": 29,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-style": "italic",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Google Advertising",
          "text_hash": "6fbc0dcb438be8d3f9cf6801706dfe301f88a49970230aaacfb5491e80800b07",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000419-f09cf343",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[450]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 419,
          "reported_page": 29,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Google advertising revenues are comprised of the following:",
          "text_hash": "f09cf343ae079b830e1fbcce0ef7b088104e32b60463151c4a7a2beec546a07f",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000420-ade0cd1f",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[451]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 420,
          "reported_page": 29,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•Google Search & other, which includes revenues generated on Google search properties (including revenues from traffic generated by search distribution partners who use Google.com as their default search in browsers, toolbars, etc.), and other Google owned and operated properties like Gmail, Google Maps, and Google Play;",
          "text_hash": "ade0cd1f8761d41b09239a0700fa96e0625f19fee34eb877eba78d9bd9896493",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000421-cbea10bb",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[452]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 421,
          "reported_page": 29,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•YouTube ads, which includes revenues generated on YouTube properties; and",
          "text_hash": "cbea10bbe4c18274bcfdd6c727f055ee9825373723174642d32f1d028ceccce2",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "block_id": "block-000422-54bfd941",
          "dom_path": "/html/body/div[453]",
          "image_asset_id": null,
          "layout_role": null,
          "ordinal": 422,
          "reported_page": 29,
          "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_82",
          "style_signature": {
            "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
            "font-size": "10pt",
            "font-weight": "400",
            "line-height": "120%",
            "margin-top": "6pt",
            "padding-left": "36pt",
            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "-18pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "•Google Network, which includes revenues generated on Google Network properties participating in AdMob, AdSense, and Google Ad Manager.",
          "text_hash": "54bfd9411900dada3dd11aa6d45aba7ca300c9b2bedf5e9615956bb458b5f7bb",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
